  <p class="sig-basis" data-testid="publication-basis" data-copy="MB-01 MB-02">
    Published on the maintainer's own rights and publication decisions. No
    lawyer's written opinion has been obtained; nothing here states that this
    publication has been cleared by counsel.
  </p>

  <h2>Freshness and coverage</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/data-freshness/">Data freshness</a> — per source: last successful run, last content change, current status, and stale-entity counts measured against predicate volatility (§32.4).</li>
    <li><a href="/coverage-metrics/">Coverage metrics</a> — counted quantities with named denominators, records-derived bounds, reconciliation ratios, and measured survey recall (§32.5).</li>
    <li><a href="/style-guide/">Editorial style guide</a> and <a href="/editorial-standards/">editorial standards</a> — the register rules that govern every published sentence, including generated text.</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
